      "text": "{\"story\":{\"as_a\":\"user of the to-do list\",\"i_want\":\"to mark a task as Completed\",\"so_that\":\"I can record which tasks are finished\",\"business_description\":\"The to-do management page lets the user manage a personal task list. This story lets the user set the status of a task to Completed. The backend stores the new status and sets the Completion Date to the time of the change. The frontend shows the new status only after the backend confirms the change.\",\"business_value\":\"Users can see which tasks are finished, and the task report can count completed tasks.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[{\"given\":\"a task with status Open exists\",\"when\":\"the user marks the task as Completed and the backend accepts the request\",\"then\":\"the backend stores the status Completed and sets the Completion Date to the time of the change\"},{\"given\":\"a task with status Open exists and the status change request has been sent but the backend has not responded\",\"when\":\"the task list is displayed\",\"then\":\"the task row shows status Open and no success message is shown\"},{\"given\":\"a status change request for an existing task fails in the backend\",\"when\":\"the frontend receives the failure\",\"then\":\"the task row still shows the previous status and an error message is shown\"},{\"given\":\"no task exists with the ID in the status change request\",\"when\":\"the backend processes the request\",\"then\":\"the backend returns a task not found error and no stored task is changed\"},{\"given\":\"a status change request has no status value\",\"when\":\"the backend validates the request\",\"then\":\"the backend rejects the request with a missing mandatory field error and the stored task is unchanged\"},{\"given\":\"a status change request has a status value other than Completed\",\"when\":\"the backend validates the request\",\"then\":\"the backend rejects the request with an invalid input error and the stored status does not change\"}],\"edge_cases\":[\"A request to mark a task that is already Completed: the PRD does not say whether it succeeds without change or is rejected. Open question for the team.\",\"Reverting a Completed task to Open is not stated in the PRD and is outside this story. Until the PRD says otherwise, only Completed is accepted as the target status.\",\"The PRD does not say whether the Last Updated Date changes when the status changes. Open question for the team.\",\"A database or internal error during the save returns an error, and the frontend does not show the task as Completed.\"],\"dependencies\":[\"US-create-task\"],\"definition_of_done\":[\"The status change endpoint sets the status to Completed and sets the Completion Date, verified by an automated test.\",\"Requests for a missing task, a missing status and an invalid status return the not found, missing field and invalid input errors, verified by automated tests.\",\"The Completed control shows the new status only after a successful backend response, verified by a test.\",\"On a failed or pending request the row keeps the previous status, and no success message is shown.\",\"The open questions about completing an already Completed task and about Last Updated Date are recorded in the story.\"]},\"tasks\":[{\"key_slug\":\"status-change-endpoint\",\"title\":\"[BE] Add status change endpoint that sets a task to Completed and stores Completion Date\",\"track\":\"backend\",\"area\":\"backend\",\"description\":\"Add the endpoint that changes the status of an existing task to Completed. Store the status and set the Completion Date to the time of the change, using the Status and Completion Date fields and the task table created by US-create-task.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":false,\"touches_db\":true,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-244669c0\",\"R-2304218f\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"Endpoint stores status Completed for an existing task.\",\"Completion Date is set to the time of the change.\",\"Automated test covers a successful status change and the stored values.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"status-change-error-handling\",\"title\":\"[BE] Return task not found, missing field and invalid input errors for status change\",\"track\":\"backend\",\"area\":\"backend\",\"description\":\"Handle errors in the status change endpoint: task not found, missing status value, status value other than Completed, and internal or database errors. Use the simple error handling approach from the PRD. Store nothing when a request fails.\",\"size\":\"S\",\"consumes_api\":false,\"touches_db\":true,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-9dc414dc\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"A request for a missing task returns a task not found error and changes nothing.\",\"A request with no status returns a missing mandatory field error.\",\"A request with a status other than Completed returns an invalid input error and the stored status does not change.\",\"A database or internal error returns an error response, verified by automated test.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"status-toggle-control\",\"title\":\"[FE] Add Mark as Completed control to task rows that updates after backend confirmation\",\"track\":\"frontend\",\"area\":\"frontend\",\"description\":\"Add a control to each task row in the task list that marks the task as Completed by calling the status change endpoint. Show the new status only after the backend confirms the change. On failure, keep the previous status and show an error message. While the request is pending, show the previous status and no success message.\",\"size\":\"M\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":false,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-2304218f\",\"R-ab9e9cb0\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"The control calls the status change endpoint for the task.\",\"The row shows Completed only after a successful response.\",\"A failed request shows an error message and keeps the previous status.\",\"A pending request shows the previous status and no success message.\"]},{\"key_slug\":\"status-change-test-suite\",\"title\":\"[QA] Test suite for the Mark as Completed status change endpoint and control\",\"track\":\"qa_general\",\"area\":\"qa\",\"description\":\"Write the automated tests for the status change endpoint, its error responses and the Completed control, including the rule that the frontend does not show success before backend confirmation.\",\"size\":\"M\",\"consumes_api\":true,\"touches_db\":true,\"requirement_ids\":[\"R-2304218f\",\"R-244669c0\",\"R-9dc414dc\",\"R-ab9e9cb0\"],\"is_spike\":false,\"definition_of_done\":[\"Tests cover success, not found, missing field, invalid input and internal error cases.\",\"Tests check the stored status and Completion Date after a successful change.\",\"Tests check that a failed or pending request shows no success state.\",\"All tests pass in the continuous integration pipeline.\"]}]}",
